abstract: >-
  A conceptual ontology for modeling enterprise risk knowledge, with a
  source-preserving native exchange, bounded OWL mapping, scoped evaluation
  receipts and generated documentation. Version 0.3.1 is the conceptual
  design version; see the release notes for publication maturity and limits.
keywords:
  - risk ontology
  - enterprise risk knowledge
  - OntoUML
  - ontology engineering
